      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JUST QUICKLY (1) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fifth (22.66) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Form at the trip sound including seven wins. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Should bounce back. IRISH CARLA (8) has missed the placings at her last couple but was in the money three back when second (17.03) at Healesville in a Grade 5. Can turn it around this time. POWDER DRY (3) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fifth (22.60) in a Grade 5 at this track. Solid record here winning three races. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to his name from six starts. Great chance to atone. DIM SIM RIXI (6) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
